You put all your focus into escaping combat for 4 turns. While under this effect you gain [22%, 29%, 34%, 38%, 41% (TL1-5)] increased resistance to all damage, [5.0, 6.7, 8.0, 9.0, 10 (TL1-5)] increased stamina regeneration, immunity to stun, pin, daze and slowing effects and [150%, 217%, 268%, 311%, 350% (TL1-5)] increased movement speed.

Any action other than movement will cancel this effect.
